# ScamSentry Roadmap

Where ScamSentry is today and where we want to take it. Team **Hental Mealth** (Computer Applications Hons. Data Science, Chandigarh University).

The big idea does not change: **warn at the moment of reading, not after the payment, and always explain why.**

Legend: ✅ done in the prototype · 🔨 next · 🔭 later · 💡 vision

---

## Phase 0: Prototype (v0.2.0) ✅

Everything here already works inside the browser, with no server of our own.

- ✅ Chrome extension on Manifest V3
- ✅ Explainable 0–100 score where every point has a reason
- ✅ Address checks: raw IPs, punycode, `@` tricks, fake brand names, fake `gov` sites, risky endings, free website builders
- ✅ On-device scam wording rules for Indian scams (fees, task earnings, KYC and OTP threats, digital arrest, prizes, fake virus and update prompts, APK lures)
- ✅ Domain age lookup (RDAP) with caching and rate limiting
- ✅ Public phishing feed and optional URLhaus malware list
- ✅ Blocking page for known malware sites
- ✅ Redirect chain tracking ("how did I get here?")
- ✅ Warning banner, popup, settings page and trusted sites list

