## Phase 3: Wider reach 🔭

*Goal: protect people wherever scams reach them.*

- [ ] Hindi and Hinglish scam detection
- [ ] QR code and screenshot scanning (OCR)
- [ ] Firefox and Edge versions
- [ ] Personal dashboard of blocked threats
- [ ] Site-specific helpers for Gmail and WhatsApp Web, with selectors kept in one config file so a layout change does not break us

---

## Phase 4: Vision 💡

*Goal: a scam shield for every screen.*

- [ ] Android app that checks SMS and notifications
- [ ] On-device AI, so it works offline and data never leaves the phone
- [ ] Live alerts during scam calls using speech-to-text
- [ ] Pre-filled complaints for cybercrime.gov.in and the 1930 helpline
- [ ] Open threat-feed API for banks and telecoms, so every confirmed report protects more people

