## Known risks we plan for

| Risk | Plan |
|---|---|
| False alarms on genuine messages | CAUTION level before HIGH, verified-domain allowlist, "Not a scam" button |
| Privacy of personal chats and email | Rules run on the device, short snippets only, nothing stored unless reported |
| Prompt injection inside scam text | Quoted data, strict JSON, AI never decides the score alone |
| Free API limits | Caching and fallback to feeds and rules |
| Fake reports against genuine sites | Score threshold and repeat reports before blocking |
| Gmail or WhatsApp layout changes | Selectors in one config file, fall back to scanning every link |

